cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the software and the associated paper."
title: "CBH-CR hybrid model: crown base height and crown ratio for Korean forests from NFI data"
abstract: >-
  A hybrid allometric (Hasenauer–Monserud) + machine-learning (XGBoost) pipeline that predicts
  crown base height (CBH) and crown ratio (CR) for tree species in the Republic of Korea from
  National Forest Inventory data, with plot-disjoint cross-validation, and produces nationwide
  5 m CBH/CR maps.
type: software
